{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121612","id":4102347511,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc70hNr3","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121612","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121612.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121612.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121612","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121612/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121612/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121612/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b0bbd67d98151c8cc9b1d89b4dac9dee8562d28f","number":121612,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Revalidate open scripts on warning settings changes","user":{"login":"kian-g","id":75186370,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MTg2Mzcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75186370?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kian-g","html_url":"https://github.com/kian-g","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kian-g/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kian-g/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kian-g/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kian-g/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kian-g/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kian-g/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kian-g/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kian-g/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kian-g/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\nWhen changing GDScript warning-related Project Settings under debug/gdscript/warnings, open script tabs didnt immediately refresh their diagnostics. This left leave stale warnings visible until a manual revalidation trigger (such as editing/reopening the script).\r\n\r\nThis PR makes ScriptEditor react to ProjectSettings updates and revalidate all open script editors when settings in the warning group change, so diagnostics update immediately after toggling warning options.\r\n\r\n- Closes #56266\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nImplementation summary:\r\n- Connected ScriptEditor to the ProjectSettings settings_changed signal during editor setup.\r\n- Added a ScriptEditor handler that:\r\n\t- Checks whether the change affects debug/gdscript/warnings.\r\n\t- Iterates open script tabs.\r\n\t- Calls validate_script() on each ScriptEditorBase instance.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null